preadsheets. Just don't plan on editing video.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge\">Want the best all-rounder?</span>\n        <strong>Aero 14</strong> — The OLED screen is stunning, 18 hours of battery covers full workdays, and it stays quiet. It's the one to buy if you don't need raw horsepower.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge\">Need serious power?</span>\n        <strong>Forge 16</strong> — 16 cores, 55 W TDP, 32 GB RAM, and every port you could want. You'll pay for it in weight and battery, but nothing else here can render a timeline or run a game.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"alert\">\n    <strong>Note:</strong> All three are priced at MSRP. Check for educational or seasonal discounts — the Nimbus 13 frequently drops below $899.\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n```","deltas":[[5426,"```html\n"],[5519,"<div class=\"page"],[5532," stack gap-lg\">"],[5550,"\n\n"],[5560,"  <div class"],[5699,"=\"stack gap-sm"],[5711,"\">\n    <"],[5770,"h1>Laptop"],[5780," Comparison</h"],[5808,"1>\n   "],[5821," <p"],[5879," class=\"lead\">"],[5951,"Three machines, three"],[5968," philosoph"],[6031,"ies. Here's"],[6040," how"],[6068," they stack up so"],[6146," you can pick the"],[6161," right one.</p"],[6181,">\n   "],[6191," <div class=\""],[6293,"row gap-sm\""],[6330," style=\"flex-wrap"],[6341,":wrap;\">\n"],[6402,"      <span class"],[6507,"=\"badge badge-secondary"],[6543,"\">Weight winner:"],[6553," Nimbus 13"],[6626,"</span>\n"],[6652,"      <span class"],[6728,"=\"badge badge-secondary"],[6802,"\">Battery winner:"],[6814," Nimbus 1"],[6814,"3</span>"],[6876,"\n     "],[6886," <span class=\""],[6945,"badge badge-secondary"],[6989,"\">Performance winner:"],[6999," Forge 1"],[6999,"6</span>"],[7050,"\n      <span"],[7126," class=\"badge badge"],[7177,"-secondary\">Value winner"],[7178,": Aero "],[7190,"14</span"],[7200,">\n    </"],[7261,"div>\n "],[7271," </div>\n\n"],[74